  "name": "OrderDesk \u2013 WhatsApp \u201cWhere's My Order?\u201d AI Agent with Live Shopify + Courier Data and Human Handoff",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "719e799c-ea69-470b-b40c-adc624f5fa33",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2013 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 752,
        "height": 856,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udce6 OrderDesk \u2013 WhatsApp \"Where's My Order?\" AI Agent\n\nFor Shopify D2C brands in India where most WhatsApp support is the same question: where is my order? Agents spend the day copying tracking numbers between Shopify and the courier panel while real problems wait.\n\n### How it works\nA customer messages your WhatsApp number in English, Hindi or Hinglish. An AI agent looks up their orders by phone number, or by order number after checking it's really theirs. It then pulls live tracking from Shiprocket and replies with concrete facts: status, courier, AWB, expected delivery and a tracking link. It can also explain your return policy.\n\nWhen the customer asks for a human, reports damage or a refund issue, or the bot fails twice in a row, the chat switches to human mode. Your team gets a Slack card, and further messages are forwarded there. One click on the card's resume link hands the chat back to the bot.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect WhatsApp Business Cloud (trigger and send), OpenAI, Google Sheets and Slack.\n2. Add a Shopify custom-app token (`read_orders`) as Header Auth (`X-Shopify-Access-Token`), and Shiprocket as Custom Auth with `{\"body\":{\"email\":\"\u2026\",\"password\":\"\u2026\"}}`.\n3. Create a sheet with **WISMO Conversations** and **WISMO Log** tabs, and replace the `REPLACE_\u2026` store domain, sheet, channel and n8n URL.\n4. Edit **return_policy** with your own rules, then send yourself a test message."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b9865629-fd3d-40a0-ae0d-dcdeeb0ec5e9",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2013 Message Intake & Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1760,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1296,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcf2 Message Intake & Routing\nEach WhatsApp message is parsed and checked against the conversation sheet. If a human has taken over, the bot steps aside. Voice notes, images and stickers get a polite \"please type\" instead."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4e222cc2-3902-445a-805d-f522a6992ace",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2013 AI Order Agent",
