      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1680,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## \ud83e\udde0 AI Order Agent\nThe agent pulls live data: the sender's recent Shopify orders, any order by number (only shown if the phone or email matches), Shiprocket tracking and your return policy. It remembers the last 10 messages per phone and never guesses."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
