        "content": "## \ud83d\ude4b Human Mode & Unsupported\nWhile a human is handling the chat, new messages are forwarded to Slack. Messages the bot can't read get a short request to type it out."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db5b67f3-d70a-429a-bb74-ca95d3f427f6",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2013 Reply, Log & Handoff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4880,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1584,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcac Reply, Log & Handoff\nGuardrails check the reply, hide details if ownership didn't match, and fall back if the AI fails. The reply is sent and logged. Handoffs switch the chat to human mode and post a Slack card with a resume link."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bb03d300-d450-4d75-a2bf-4a76d3aa9c3e",
